// The one pixel stage of the original Xbox's 3D backend (docs/RENDER3D.md "Original Xbox backend"): texture colour times the
// lit vertex colour (col0, already shrunk by 1 - fog), plus the fog share the vertex program put in col1 (fog amount times
// fog colour). Source for tools/xbox-og/shaders/make_shaders.sh (nxdk's fp20compiler); the generated
// engine/platform/nxdk/hw3d_ps.inl is committed.
!!TS1.0
texture_2d();
!!RC1.0
{
  rgb
  {
    spare0 = tex0.rgb * col0.rgb;
  }
  alpha
  {
    spare0 = tex0.a * col0.a;
  }
}
out.rgb = unsigned(spare0.rgb) + unsigned(col1.rgb);
out.a = unsigned(spare0.a);
